``` SOC-RULE-037: Remote Access Tool Started from a User-Writable Path (generated from rules/sigma/win_remote_access_tool.yml; review before use) ```
index=* (EventCode=1 OR EventCode=4688) | where (((match('Image', "(?i)\\\\AnyDesk\\.exe$") OR match('Image', "(?i)\\\\TeamViewer\\.exe$") OR match('Image', "(?i)\\\\ScreenConnect\\.ClientService\\.exe$") OR match('Image', "(?i)\\\\AteraAgent\\.exe$") OR match('Image', "(?i)\\\\rustdesk\\.exe$"))) AND ((match('Image', "(?i)\\\\Downloads\\\\") OR match('Image', "(?i)\\\\Temp\\\\") OR match('Image', "(?i)\\\\AppData\\\\") OR match('Image', "(?i)\\\\Users\\\\Public\\\\"))))
